OL,3,GNEWSA'Special' synagogue gets #232,000
OL,4,Afunding boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Victorian synagogue in Grimsby has
OL,7,Fsecured #232,500 of funding to allow
OL,8,Frestoration work to continue.
OL,10,FThe Sir Moses Montefiore Memorial
OL,11,FSynagogue is one of the first
OL,12,Frecipients of Historic England's new
OL,13,FPlaces of Worship Renewal Fund after
OL,14,Fsuffering years of damp and flooding.
OL,16,FThe money will fund structural repairs
OL,17,Fas well as restoration of the synagogue
OL,18,Fark - a cabinet that holds the Torah
OL,19,Fscrolls.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
